"title": "Turning verbs into nouns: η αύξηση των τιμών",
"body": [
{
"p": "Formal Greek prefers **nouns** where speech uses **verbs**. The subject or object of the verb becomes a **genitive** after the noun."
},
{
"table": {
"head": [
"Verb",
"Noun"
],
"rows": [
[
"αυξάνω increase",
"η αύξηση"
],
[
