},
{
"el": "Πρέπει να ληφθούν άμεσα μέτρα.",
"en": "Measures must be taken immediately."
}
]
},
{
"tip": "The everyday equivalent is the **3rd person plural** with no subject: **Λένε ότι θα βρέξει** \"They say it'll rain\" = **Λέγεται ότι...** in writing."
},
{
"solved": [
